म-हैतुक a. caused by mere desire without any real cause, Bg.xvi.8.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kamam": [{"id": "kAmam", "headword": "कामम्", "headword_slp1": "kAmam", "fold": "kamam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कामम् ind. 1. According to wish, according to inclination, at will, काममारणात्तिष्ठेत् गृहे कन्यर्तुमत्यपि M.ix.89; 2. willingly, joyfully, Sant.S.iv.4; 3. freely, without doubt, M.ii.189, Yaj.i.32; 4. well, very well (as a particle of assent), मनागनभ्यावृत्त्या वा कामं क्षाम्यतु यः क्षमी Sis.ii.43; 5. granted, no doubt, admitted that, [usually followed by तु or तथापि (yet, still) as its correlative] कामं प्रिया न सुलभा मनस्तु तद्भावदर्शनायासि Sak.ii., R.vi.22, iv.13, xii.75; 6. indeed, really, surely (implying at the same time a contradiction or unwillingness.)", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kamayamana": [{"id": "kAmayamAna", "headword": "कामयमान", "headword_slp1": "kAmayamAna", "fold": "kamayamana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कामयमान a. (f. ना) Lustful, libidinous, R.xix.50.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "kAmayamAnA", "headword": "कामयमाना", "headword_slp1": "kAmayamAnA", "fold": "kamayamana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कामयमान a. (f. ना) Lustful, libidinous, R.xix.50.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kamalika": [{"id": "kAmalikA", "headword": "कामलिका", "headword_slp1": "kAmalikA", "fold": "kamalika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कामलिका f. Spirituous liquor.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kamin": [{"id": "kAmin", "headword": "कामिन्", "headword_slp1": "kAmin", "fold": "kamin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कामिन् (I) a. (f. नी) Lustful.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कामिन् (II) m. 1. A lover, a lustful man who pays attention to women, कामीवार्द्रापराधः स दहतु दुरितं शांभवो वः शराग्निः Am.S.2, Rt.i.3; 2. a uxorious husband; 3. a sparrow; 4.